---
description: Commit and push each completed project change
alwaysApply: true
---

- This is a personal project. Work directly on `main` and push to `origin/main`; do not create feature branches or pull requests unless the user explicitly asks.
- After completing a change, run the appropriate checks, commit the task's files, and push before reporting completion.
- Keep secrets, generated builds and unrelated user edits out of commits. Never force-push. If a commit or push fails, report the blocker and the local branch/commit state.
- Include the pushed branch and short commit ID in the completion message.
